OL,3,AToilet paper and secret recorders: What
OL,4,Awe know about the arrest of the Saudi
OL,5,AOpenAI engineer
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Saudi national who worked for OpenAI
OL,8,Fappeared in court this week for
OL,9,Fallegedly planting a secret recording
OL,10,Fdevice behind a TV in one of the tech
OL,11,Fgiant's meeting rooms.
OL,13,FAbdulrahman Alfozan, a 35-year-old
OL,14,Fengineer, was arrested by the FBI and
OL,15,Fcharged with using or attempting to use
OL,16,Fa device "to intercept oral
OL,17,Fcommunications".
OL,19,FAs yet, it is not clear what he was
OL,20,Fplanning to do with the recordings.
OL,22,FBut, here's we do know so far.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
